{"id":2213,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>随着2026年全国硕士研究生招生录取工作圆满落幕，航空宇航学院学子喜报频传，升学质量与数量再上新台阶。据统计，学院2026届336名本科毕业生中，共有132名同学成功考取硕士研究生，整体升学率达39.29%，较去年提升7.42个百分点，创近年来最佳成绩。</p><p><strong>一、升学率创近年新高，多专业实现大幅增长</strong></p><p>各专业表现亮点纷呈，展现出航空宇航学院扎实的教学基础与浓厚的学术氛围：</p><ul><li><p><strong>飞行器设计与工程专业升学率高达55%，已接近学校最高升学率院系水平；</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>工程力学专业升学率达40%，较去年大幅提升11.08个百分点；</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>飞行器制造工程专业升学率达28.1%，较去年提升6.67个百分点。</strong></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nRvVYL49ZMNCan2zlYUmNDM4nkLzldiUlWRM8LbnNUsMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRU1hkMYyDoRGaolQ2L4WRUN-sL7CDnlC4U4vsU4NbUlWFUmNsnRVfUNWFLNLaLN7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0CBB768009FF32CBB70F6EF3C77C99AB/B97D1ABB/2C02A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"637\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nRvVYL49ZMNCan2zlYUmNDM4nkLzldiUlWRM8LbnNUsMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRU1hkMYyDoRGaolQ2L4WRUN-sL7CDnlC4U4vsU4NbUlWFUmNsnRVfUNWFLNLaLN7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nz-VDLmnfUzL4L2zGYMzn2LzQRLmvd4LlLanm7bLRQVMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyDM1hVUSyDLRUDn7nRnlLbLlMknmU4L4VkLRC8LzVkLzQFozA7M498oRTFLllPnzNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/066EA6046DDCEC91CBF4331B06411B16/98D78489/1E1E9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"636\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nz-VDLmnfUzL4L2zGYMzn2LzQRLmvd4LlLanm7bLRQVMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyDM1hVUSyDLRUDn7nRnlLbLlMknmU4L4VkLRC8LzVkLzQFozA7M498oRTFLllPnzNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7LllVaolCDM4v8M2zMVMmnkMlWVUmGdiU4N8nNn7Uz-iMzG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYLSy4nkhRMmM2MRCYLRVVL8WfMR7PM8UanlVfLzNbnRMFnR6Rnl7PnzfFLlLsM8LJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6213DC63F46201E3BA4117D0EAA199D3/D7CEA1E0/1C77C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"636\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7LllVaolCDM4v8M2zMVMmnkMlWVUmGdiU4N8nNn7Uz-iMzG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYLSy4nkhRMmM2MRCYLRVVL8WfMR7PM8UanlVfLzNbnRMFnR6Rnl7PnzfFLlLsM8LJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\"></p><p>从录取结果来看，本届毕业生升学去向呈现出“头部引领、多点开花”的鲜明特点。录取院校中，既有北京航空航天大学、西北工业大学、北京理工大学、哈尔滨工业大学、厦门大学、国防科技大学、大连理工大学等国内顶尖高校，也有南京航空航天大学、南京理工大学、合肥工业大学等航空、机械领域特色鲜明的强校；此外，部分学生选择继续留校深造，考取本校研究生，在熟悉的学术沃土中持续深耕。</p></li></ul><p><strong>二、榜样风采：2031宿舍全员上岸，“一屋皆锦”成佳话</strong></p><p>在今年的考研升学中，航空宇航学院2031宿舍六位女生全员成功上岸，分别被重庆大学、中南大学、中北大学、西北工业大学等高校录取，成为本届考研中一道亮丽的风景线。</p><p>刘佳月（保研至重庆大学）、张霖（保研至中南大学）、杨静（保研至中北大学）、车巨芳（考研至西北工业大学）、毕心怡（考研至西北工业大学）、焦佳乐（考研至中北大学）——六位同学虽各有所长、路径不同，却在朝夕相伴中携手奋进。她们坚持学习资料共享、备考节奏同步、难点共同攻克，形成了浓厚的学习氛围；生活中彼此包容、和睦相处，用良好的舍风带动优良的学风。最终，六人凭借扎实的专业基础和顽强的拼搏精神，共同书写了“一屋皆锦”的励志故事。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7n7-V8Ll7ioR7bn27M2olnkUmVkUNQd7MzvbLN78Um7bLml0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkn1ysM1yDoRC8MmNYnm6kMmGDLzvbUzAfLRnfUzGbMmVFMR7bLRr2UNQFnmf2n7lJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7BF766864692F7B606179A8A04AA0961/41905FBF/F0FDE\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MmnVfnzNPozQRL2lV2nz7sMm6kL7ndkU8U4MmQkMzUYMzN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8L1h2LYyYMRrfLm-4Ul78MzNbLzCZozL4UN7bnRQ7olMFUmr7ozWVLRfFL4VfMR7sgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyboRlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><h3><p>三、多措并举：构建全过程考研支持体系</p></h3><p>航空宇航学院始终将高质量升学作为人才培养的重要抓手，本学年通过系统谋划、精准施策，构建起覆盖考研全过程的支持体系。<br></p><p><strong>1. 早期动员与目标引导：</strong>从大二下学期开始，通过年级大会、专业导学课、学长分享会等形式，引导学生科学规划未来发展方向，明确考研或就业路径。明确考研或就业路径。前期通过专业班会进一步细化引导，帮助学生根据自身情况及早厘清双向路径。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7M77VaolUDMmlPn2zMRnmNPUzLsLRNdboR7DU8CDoz7PL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaMYyiLkyYLmvsn7l8Uz6VLR-8UmlinRnRUz-ZU4LboznFMzvYL4-8MRMFLNCPMm-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F07502277DE4A7E024B55D4CA28C3994/57232443/2F162\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7M77VaolUDMmlPn2zMRnmNPUzLsLRNdboR7DU8CDoz7PL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaMYyiLkyYLmvsn7l8Uz6VLR-8UmlinRnRUz-ZU4LboznFMzvYL4-8MRMFLNCPMm-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MNWV2L8UYMm-bn27linmvbn7rfMzGdYnRlYnm-io7CZMml0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh2n1hVLYyiM7lsUlLDUzGiMN-YozNDUmTkL7MfMRG8M8WFMmM2LRG4M7QFL4GbnRGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EFFE354E7AC6A056B2996B9B0CA4047B/63F0034F/309D0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MNWV2L8UYMm-bn27linmvbn7rfMzGdYnRlYnm-io7CZMml0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh2n1hVLYyiM7lsUlLDUzGiMN-YozNDUmTkL7MfMRG8M8WFMmM2LRG4M7QFL4GbnRGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nlWVRMR62M4Tkn27CYM4n2nl-YLlUd4MNCbLzAVoznRn7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfMSyZUSy8ozAkU8r7LzL8nl7ZMRUaMzNDnzMfLm-8oRfFU4U4n7QVn7VFMmnfM4LJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3A58A498BCED134EA8440596E3A22480/C43DFEDA/64A73\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nlWVRMR62M4Tkn27CYM4n2nl-YLlUd4MNCbLzAVoznRn7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfMSyZUSy8ozAkU8r7LzL8nl7ZMRUaMzNDnzMfLm-8oRfFU4U4n7QVn7VFMmnfM4LJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2.&nbsp;精准指导与过程服务：</strong>针对计划考研学生组织动员会，提供院校选择分析、备考经验分享等系列指导。同时建立“考研学生台账”，实行动态跟踪与心理支持。临近硕士研究生招生考试，学院为200余名考研学子发放暖心“考研大礼包”。学院领导、班主任和辅导员们亲临现场，将装有考试文具、励志书签、定制可乐、士力架及暖宝宝贴的礼包送至学生手中，传递学院关怀，帮助学子坚定信念、缓解压力、冲刺备考。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nmQVRozCsUzUZU2mTfUm62nlLDolldiUlliL4-DnzGDoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyDUSybLkhVoR62M8lio77sM7lPnzLDM7n7nNM2nzLDLmfFnNnRL8l4UmTFMRQfM49Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C6A90E87F7E58A74E1E364DDFCFE3620/FDC3E3B9/46A78\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7oR7VbnR6kLln2n2lUYolUDLmQVLRUdaMzvanRUaL8-8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZLkyYMYyZL4n7LzGsUlL8oR7YnmLDoRlaMmCsLmCZM8WFollYM8QVnm6FM4QfoRffgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyboRlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7UzlVYMzV7UzW7L2l-ZnmvaMNLaMzrdfnlUsMzGYnlr7LRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfMSyDU1yDL778MRCiMNMkollZUmrfLz9Dnl-DUzV2nzfFLmUbMmf2MmTFM7-8UmCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3A56B60A44656CB9E8B5A186EB6A1FE0/24960F69/4B4B6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7M8-VsMmr7nz6RM2mTfL4TVUNLYL4rd2olCZn77YLm6VL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyaLkyZMYhfMRffM8-4M7CanzQVLlMRUlLYnNMfMzQfMNMFUz7snlrkMlrFMNlinNrkgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyboRlsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>3.&nbsp;就业绿色通道：</strong>对于未参加考研或考研失利的学生，学院及时启动“就业绿色通道”，联合校就业指导中心提供简历指导、岗位推送、专场招聘对接等服务，帮助有需求的学生顺利就业。学院坚持以生为本，确保每一位毕业生“人人有方向、个个有支持”。</p><p>考研升学率是衡量本科教学质量与学风建设成效的重要指标之一。航空宇航学院将认真总结2026届考研工作的成功经验，进一步优化“课程教学—科研训练—升学指导—就业服务”四位一体的人才培养链条，力争在2027届毕业生中实现升学率的新突破。“大鹏一日同风起，扶摇直上九万里。”祝愿2026届全体上岸学子在更高平台上砥砺前行、展翅翱翔。也愿后来者以榜样为光、以梦想为翼，在即将到来的考研征程中乘风破浪、再创辉煌！<br></p><p><br></p><div><br></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nRvVYL49ZMNCan2zlYUmNDM4nkLzldiUlWRM8LbnNUsMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRU1hkMYyDoRGaolQ2L4WRUN-sL7CDnlC4U4vsU4NbUlWFUmNsnRVfUNWFLNLaLN7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZMzvJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9857&e=.png"}